  "prefLabel": "Occ 102.02 Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Occ 102.02 “Board” means “board” as defined in RSA 326-C:1, I, namely, “the occupational therapy governing board established in RSA 328-F.”\n\nSource. #8572, eff 1-26-05; ss by #13081, eff 7-31-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Occ 100); ss by #14366, eff 9-9-25 (formerly Occ 102.01)",
